exports[`Stufe 1 ohne Plan-5-Preise wie vor 5b > Pakete mit Terminen offen 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/branding/kottke/logo-umzuege.png"/><div class="portal-columns"><div class="portal-stack"><div aria-live="polite" class="empty:hidden"></div><section data-portal-section="date-picker" class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-card" style="border-color:var(--border)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b px-6 py-3" style="border-color:var(--border)"><div class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Bitte Termin wählen</div><div class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">2 Vorschläge</div></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:mb-5">Wir haben dir die folgenden Termine reserviert. Bitte wähle eine Variante, damit wir verbindlich für dich planen können.</p><div class="grid gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><article class="group relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-background p-4 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm"><span class="absolute -top-2 left-3 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-white" style="background:#c2570c">Empfohlen</span><header><div class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Freitag</div><h3 class="display mt-0.5 text-xl font-medium leading-none">27. November</h3></header><ul class="-m-1 flex flex-wrap"><li class="p-1"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition active:scale-[0.97] disabled:opacity-50" style="border-color:var(--border)">vormittags · 08:00 bis 11:00</button></li></ul></article><article class="group relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-background p-4 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm"><header><div class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Samstag</div><h3 class="display mt-0.5 text-xl font-medium leading-none">28. November</h3></header><ul class="-m-1 flex flex-wrap"><li class="p-1"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition active:scale-[0.97] disabled:opacity-50" style="border-color:var(--border)">ganztags</button></li></ul><p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Samstag</p></article></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:mt-5"><span>Keiner der Termine passt?</span><a href="https://wa.me/490000000000?text=Hallo%20Kottke-Umz%C3%BCge%2C%20die%20vorgeschlagenen%20Termine%20passen%20bei%20mir%20leider%20nicht.%20Welche%20Alternativen%20gibt%20es%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg>Schreib uns kurz</a></div></div></section><section class="portal-panel"><div class="portal-offer-intro"><div class="portal-panel-heading"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><div><h2>Unsere Angebote für dich</h2><div class="portal-panel-description"><p>Wir haben die Optionen für deinen Umzug erstellt. Wähle das passende Angebot für dich aus.</p></div></div></div><span>Auftragsnummer: <strong>VORSCHAU-2026</strong></span></div><section data-portal-section="packages" class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Wähle aus 3 Optionen</h2><span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Antippen zum Auswählen</span></div><ul class="portal-package-list "><li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-busy="false" class="portal-package-card"><div class="portal-package-title"><span class="portal-package-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><path d="m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7"></path><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></span><div><strong>Basic</strong><p>Nur Transport</p></div></div><div class="portal-package-price-wrap"><div class="portal-price portal-package-price">1.360,49 €</div><p class="portal-package-price-label">Festpreis</p></div><ul class="portal-package-features"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Transport laut Angebot</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>LKW inkl. km, Treibstoff, Maut</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.